{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0

Rule 17 (primitive type variable must be non-negative)
{v_1 : int ⊎ float} |= v_1 ≥ 0

Rule 12 (a primitive type variable is smaller than the other)
{v_1 : int ⊎ float, v_2 : int ⊎ float} |= v_1 ≤ v_2

Rule 14 (tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0

Rule 8 (tensor must have an integer dtype: 1–5)
{v1: tensor} |= 1 ≤ dtype(v1) ∧ dtype(v1) ≤ 5

